    <briefdescription>
<para>fms_diag_fieldbuff_update_mod Contains routines for updating the buffer (array) of field data statistics (e.g. average, rms) with new field data. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Miguel Zuniga</para></simplesect>
<computeroutput>fms_diag_fieldbuff_update_mod</computeroutput> contains routines for updating the buffer (array) of field data statistics (e.g. average, rms) with new field data. These routines are called by the send_data routines in the diag_manager. </para>    </detaileddescription>
